[{"id":2837891346,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pJskS","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352#pullrequestreview-2837891346","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106352","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-13T19:26:23Z"},{"id":2838281818,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pLL5a","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"At any rate, I confirmed that this solves the https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98090 problem after setting Quaternion with EulerEditor.\r\n\r\nAs a request, the `EditorPropertyQuaternion` is reused in the `BonePropertiesEditor`, so the step there needs to be changed as well.\r\n\r\n> Perhaps there needs to be separate settings for drag step and the actual number step, but that's a larger proposal...\r\n\r\nI agree that ideally this is the best way.\r\n\r\nThis may not be much of a concern, but as commented in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106335#issuecomment-2875934305, if anyone copy values from other Editors, such as the normalized Plane Editor, or from a user-created Quaternion Editor with a step of `0.001`, and paste them into the Quaternion editor, there is no guarantee that they are normalized.\r\n\r\nI feel there needs to be documentation somewhere about normalization in Quaternion with more detail.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352#pullrequestreview-2838281818","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106352","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-13T22:42:07Z"},{"id":2838308108,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pLSUM","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352#pullrequestreview-2838308108","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106352","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-13T23:03:31Z"},{"id":3720465634,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7dwczi","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"We discussed this with @TokageItLab and @lyuma in a rendering meeting. It makes sense to me to have a much lower step size for quaternions if the default is always too granular and causes issues with even copy-pasting in quaternions. \n\nI understand Lawnjelly's concern that there are probably _further_ usability concerns with editing normalized quarternions. But I think this makes sense as a stopgap solution to make the current behaviour at least somewhat usable. \n\nI am concerned about the behaviour change to the default spin slider drag step size. I think it should likely use the size configured in the editor to avoid a needless behaviour change. ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352#pullrequestreview-3720465634","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106352","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T03:34:33Z"},{"id":3759174606,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gEHPO","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"d9c3c87eaa103618cb58203fafcde7e7d524b2e6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352#pullrequestreview-3759174606","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106352","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-05T20:04:12Z"}]